The '''Exe''' is a passive [[Mob]] that spawns in the {{Zone|Mystic Marsh}}.

== Behavior ==
'''Exes''' float in place at their spawn locations. They do not take any damage upon being hit. Using a {{Item|Charminizer}} on an '''Exe''' will cause it to start following the player around. If 2 '''Exes''' come into contact, they will merge into a {{MobSprite|Wai}}. Using an {{Item|Atominizer}} on an Exe will cause it to drop an {{Item|X}}.

